msgid "HomeTunnel Access"
msgstr "HomeTunnel 接入"

msgid "Cloudflare is authorized (least-privilege OAuth, no full account control). Daily changes live in \"Ingress Rules\". Revoke only to start over."
msgstr "Cloudflare 已授权（OAuth 最小权限，不掌控整个账号）。日常改动请到「接入规则」页。需要重新设置时才取消授权。"

msgid "Open a browser and log into your Cloudflare account. Then follow the steps below to set up the intranet-exposure tunnel."
msgstr "请打开浏览器，登录您的CloudFlare账号。然后按照下面步骤，完成内网穿透隧道设置。"

msgid "① Cloudflare Authorization"
msgstr "① Cloudflare 授权"

msgid "② Create Tunnel"
msgstr "② 创建隧道"

msgid "③ Choose Domain"
msgstr "③ 选择域名"

msgid "④ Authorize Switch Service"
msgstr "④ 授权开关服务"

msgid "⑤ Deploy Switch Service"
msgstr "⑤ 部署开关服务"

msgid "⑥ Verify & Finish"
msgstr "⑥ 验证完成"

msgid "Setup is locked. These settings only change if you revoke the authorization."
msgstr "设置已锁定。只有取消授权后才会变更。"

msgid "Authorized domain"
msgstr "授权域名"

msgid "Switch service"
msgstr "开关服务"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "内网穿透隧道运行模式"

msgid "Checking online status…"
msgstr "正在检查在线状态…"

msgid "Online status unavailable. Check the router log."
msgstr "在线状态暂不可用，请查看路由器日志。"

msgid "Cloudflare authorization"
msgstr "Cloudflare 授权"

msgid "authorization lost — click Repair and re-authorize"
msgstr "授权丢失——点击修复并重新授权"

msgid "Tunnel"
msgstr "隧道"

msgid "deleted on Cloudflare — revoke the authorization to re-set up"
msgstr "已在 Cloudflare 上被删除——取消授权后重新设置"

msgid "Cloudflare rejected the saved certificate — revoke the authorization to re-set up"
msgstr "Cloudflare 拒绝了保存的证书——取消授权后重新设置"

msgid "domain taken over by another service"
msgstr "域名已被其他服务占用"

msgid "not deployed"
msgstr "未部署"

msgid "DNS record conflicts"
msgstr "DNS 记录冲突"

msgid "Ingress DNS records"
msgstr "接入规则 DNS 记录"

msgid "missing %s records"
msgstr "缺少 %s 条记录"

msgid "All checks passed."
msgstr "全部检查通过。"

msgid "Cloudflare authorization is required to repair. Re-authorize below."
msgstr "修复需要 Cloudflare 授权，请在下方重新授权。"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "正常"

msgid "Repair"
msgstr "修复"

msgid "Revoke Authorization"
msgstr "取消授权"

msgid "Revoking removes the tunnel, DNS records and the switch service from Cloudflare. Ingress rules are kept locally."
msgstr "取消授权会从 Cloudflare 删除隧道、DNS 记录和开关服务。接入规则保留在本地。"

msgid "Authorization revoked! Reloading…"
msgstr "已取消授权！正在刷新…"

msgid "Revoke failed — check output above"
msgstr "取消授权失败——请检查上方输出"

msgid "The router runs %s and shows an authorization URL."
msgstr "路由器将运行 %s 并显示一个授权链接。"

msgid "Open it on any device, log into Cloudflare, pick your domain and authorize."
msgstr "在任意设备打开它，登录 Cloudflare，选择你的域名并授权。"

msgid "waiting for auth URL…"
msgstr "等待授权 URL…"

msgid "Start Login"
msgstr "开始授权"

msgid "Authorized! Loading next step…"
msgstr "授权成功！正在进入下一步…"

msgid "cloudflared exited before the certificate was fetched:"
msgstr "证书尚未拉取，cloudflared 已退出："

msgid "Fix the issue (e.g. router DNS), reload this page and try again."
msgstr "修复问题（如路由器 DNS）后刷新本页重试。"

msgid "This step creates an intranet-exposure tunnel. Give it a name and click \"Create Tunnel\"."
msgstr "① 本步骤将创建一个内网穿透隧道，请指定隧道名称，然后点击“创建隧道”按钮"

msgid "The tunnel was deleted on Cloudflare. Clicking Create below will recreate it automatically (new tunnel id, DNS routes re-published in step ⑥)."
msgstr "隧道在 Cloudflare 侧被删除了。点击下方“创建”会自动重建（新隧道 ID，DNS 路由会在步骤⑥重新发布）。"

msgid "Cloudflare rejected the saved certificate. Re-run step ① first."
msgstr "Cloudflare 拒绝了已保存的证书。请先重新执行第 ① 步。"

msgid "Create Tunnel"
msgstr "创建隧道"

msgid "Created! Loading next step…"
msgstr "创建成功！正在进入下一步…"

msgid "Pick the domain for the intranet-exposure tunnel (fetched automatically from your Cloudflare account; make sure the domain is already set up on Cloudflare), then click \"Fetch Domains\" to continue."
msgstr "选择内网穿透隧道所用的域名（自动从你的 Cloudflare 账户获取，请确认你已经在Cloudflare上配置好了域名），请点击“获取域名列表”继续。"

msgid "Fetch Domains"
msgstr "获取域名列表"

msgid "Use Domain"
msgstr "使用域名"

msgid "loading…"
msgstr "加载中…"

msgid "Refetch"
msgstr "重新获取"

msgid "Saved! Loading next step…"
msgstr "已保存！正在进入下一步…"

msgid "Authorize the switch service deployment (a Cloudflare Worker)."
msgstr "授权部署开关服务（Cloudflare Worker）。"

msgid "Scan the QR code with your phone, or open the link, then tap Allow — that is the only manual step."
msgstr "用手机扫描二维码或打开链接，点一下“允许”即可——这是唯一需要动手的一步。"

msgid "Start Authorization"
msgstr "开始授权"

msgid "Failed: %s"
msgstr "失败：%s"

msgid "Already authorized! Loading next step…"
msgstr "已授权！正在进入下一步…"

msgid "Unexpected response: %s"
msgstr "意外响应：%s"

msgid "The page is served by Cloudflare and may show \"Wrangler\" — that is Cloudflare's official CLI identity and is expected."
msgstr "该页面由 Cloudflare 提供，可能显示“Wrangler”字样——这是 Cloudflare 官方命令行工具的标识，属正常现象。"

msgid "Waiting for authorization…"
msgstr "等待授权…"

msgid "The code expired (5 minutes). Click Start Authorization again."
msgstr "授权码已过期（5 分钟）。请重新点击“开始授权”。"

msgid "Full name: %s"
msgstr "完整域名：%s"

msgid "Switch service subdomain"
msgstr "开关服务子域名"

msgid "Deploy Now"
msgstr "立即部署"

msgid "The switch domain %s is already taken by another service (Worker “%s”)."
msgstr "开关域名 %s 已被其他服务占用（Worker “%s”）。"

msgid "You can type a different subdomain above and retry, or take over the domain (this removes it from that service)."
msgstr "可以在上方换一个子域名再试，或直接接管该域名（会把它从那个服务上移除）。"

msgid "Take Over and Deploy"
msgstr "接管并部署"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "The switch domain %s already has a %s DNS record."
msgstr "开关域名 %s 已有一条 %s 类型的 DNS 记录。"

msgid "Pick a different subdomain above and retry, or delete that record in the Cloudflare dashboard (DNS app) first."
msgstr "请在上方换一个子域名再试，或先到 Cloudflare 控制台（DNS 应用）删除那条记录。"

msgid "Deployed! Publishing DNS records…"
msgstr "部署完成！正在发布 DNS 记录…"

msgid "Deploy failed — check output above"
msgstr "部署失败——请检查上方输出"

msgid "Setup is complete. The switch daemon is running in %s mode."
msgstr "配置已完成，开关控制进程正在「%s」模式下运行。"

msgid "Open Status Page"
msgstr "打开状态页"

msgid "Verify the remote switch from the router, then enable the daemon and go to the status page."
msgstr "从路由器验证Cloudflare侧隧道开关，然后启用守护并进入状态页。"

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "验证"

msgid "All checks passed. Daemon enabled. Opening status page…"
msgstr "全部通过。开关控制进程已启用。正在打开状态页…"

msgid "Mode: %s — change it later in Settings."
msgstr "模式：%s——之后可在「设置」中更改。"

msgid "HomeTunnel is the Homelede intranet-exposure solution built on Cloudflare Tunnel. It works with or without a public IP, and is secure and free."
msgstr "HomeTunnel是Homelede提供的基于Cloudflare Tunnel的内网穿透方案。无论是否拥有独立公网IP均可使用，安全，免费。"

msgid "HomeTunnel"
msgstr "HomeTunnel"

msgid "Setup is not complete. Open Access to run setup."
msgstr "设置尚未完成。请到「接入」页完成设置。"

msgid "Open Access"
msgstr "打开接入页"

msgid "The tunnel was deleted on Cloudflare. Open Access — revoking the authorization will guide you through re-setup."
msgstr "隧道已在 Cloudflare 上被删除。请到「接入」页，取消授权后会引导重新设置。"

msgid "Cloudflare rejected the saved certificate. Open Access — revoking the authorization will guide you through re-setup."
msgstr "Cloudflare 拒绝了保存的证书。请到「接入」页，取消授权后会引导重新设置。"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Tunnel service"
msgstr "内网穿透隧道进程"

msgid "Tunnel on Cloudflare"
msgstr "Cloudflare侧隧道状态"

msgid "ok"
msgstr "正常"

msgid "deleted on Cloudflare"
msgstr "已在 Cloudflare 删除"

msgid "certificate rejected"
msgstr "证书被拒"

msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "on-demand (remote switch)"
msgstr "按需启停"

msgid "always-on"
msgstr "始终开启"

msgid "Switch daemon"
msgstr "内网穿透隧道开关控制进程"

msgid "Remote switch state"
msgstr "Cloudflare侧隧道开关"

msgid "Please wait…"
msgstr "请稍候…"

msgid "done"
msgstr "完成"

msgid "failed"
msgstr "失败"

msgid "Turn On (%d min)"
msgstr "开启隧道（%d 分钟）"

msgid "Turn Off"
msgstr "关闭隧道"

msgid "Remote Switch"
msgstr "Cloudflare侧隧道开关"

msgid "Switch Bookmarks"
msgstr "隧道开关书签"

msgid "Save these as bookmarks on any device to open/close the tunnel from anywhere:"
msgstr "保存为任意设备的浏览器书签，即可随时随地打开/关闭隧道："

msgid "Copy \"ON\" link"
msgstr "复制“开”链接"

msgid "Copy \"OFF\" link"
msgstr "复制“关”链接"

msgid "Recent switch daemon log"
msgstr "开关控制进程日志"

msgid "(empty)"
msgstr "（空）"

msgid "unreachable"
msgstr "不可达"

msgid "on"
msgstr "开启"

msgid "TTL remaining: %d min"
msgstr "剩余可用：%d 分钟"

msgid "auto-renewed"
msgstr "已自动续期"

msgid "off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "(log unavailable)"
msgstr "（日志不可用）"

msgid "HomeTunnel — Ingress Rules"
msgstr "HomeTunnel — 接入规则"

msgid "Each rule exposes one intranet service as <code>subdomain.domain</code> via the tunnel. Unmatched hostnames/paths always return 404."
msgstr "每条规则把一个内网服务以 <code>子域名.域名</code> 形式经隧道开放到公网。未匹配的主机名/路径一律返回 404。"

msgid "Rules"
msgstr "接入规则"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

msgid "Subdomain"
msgstr "子域名"

msgid "Service URL"
msgstr "服务地址"

msgid "cloudflared service syntax, e.g. <code>http://192.168.1.10:5000</code>, <code>ssh://192.168.1.10:22</code>, <code>tcp://…</code>"
msgstr "cloudflared 服务语法，如 <code>http://192.168.1.10:5000</code>、<code>ssh://192.168.1.10:22</code>、<code>tcp://…</code>"

msgid "Path regex"
msgstr "路径正则"

msgid "Optional. Only forward matching paths, e.g. <code>^/api(/.*)?$</code>"
msgstr "可选。仅转发匹配的路径，如 <code>^/api(/.*)?$</code>"

msgid "Origin Host header"
msgstr "回源 Host 头"

msgid "Optional. Rewrite the Host header sent to the origin (needed behind a name-based reverse proxy)."
msgstr "可选。改写发往源站的 Host 头（源站在基于域名的反代后面时需要）。"

msgid "Skip TLS verify"
msgstr "跳过 TLS 校验"

msgid "Skip certificate verification for https origins (self-signed certs)."
msgstr "对 https 源站跳过证书校验（自签名证书）。"

msgid "Connect timeout (s)"
msgstr "连接超时（秒）"

msgid "Data traffic"
msgstr "访问流量"

msgid "Always-on mode · remote switch not used"
msgstr "常开模式 · 未使用Cloudflare侧隧道开关"

msgid "Bookmark"
msgstr "书签"

msgid "Any device · no app needed"
msgstr "任意设备 · 无需 App"

msgid "Remote switch service"
msgstr "Cloudflare侧隧道开关（Worker）"

msgid "ON · %d min left"
msgstr "ON · 剩余 %d 分钟"

msgid "OpenWrt router"
msgstr "Homelede 路由器"

msgid "Polls commands every %ds"
msgstr "每 %d 秒拉取开关指令"

msgid "Tunnel process"
msgstr "内网穿透隧道进程"

msgid "start / stop"
msgstr "拉起 / 熄灭"

msgid "① Bookmark ON / OFF"
msgstr "① 书签开 / 关"

msgid "② Poll commands"
msgstr "② 轮询指令"

msgid "Browser"
msgstr "浏览器"

msgid "Any external device"
msgstr "任意外网设备"

msgid "Cloudflare edge network"
msgstr "Cloudflare 边缘网络"

msgid "%d domains"
msgstr "%d 个域名"

msgid "Auto-renew +%d min on traffic"
msgstr "有流量自动续期 +%d 分钟"

msgid "Tunnel off · unreachable"
msgstr "隧道未开启 · 不可达"

msgid "③ HTTPS"
msgstr "③ HTTPS"

msgid "LAN"
msgstr "内网 LAN"

msgid "No ingress rules yet"
msgstr "还没有接入规则"

msgid "+%d more"
msgstr "还有 %d 条"

msgid "Wizard incomplete - topology pending"
msgstr "向导未完成 · 拓扑待生成"

msgid "Finish the 7-step wizard to see your live topology here."
msgstr "完成 7 步向导后，这里将展示你的实时隧道拓扑。"

msgid "Live topology generated from your configuration."
msgstr "由你的配置实时生成的拓扑图。"

msgid "Setup is not complete. Run the wizard first."
msgstr "配置尚未完成，请先运行向导。"

msgid "Open Wizard"
msgstr "打开向导"

msgid "Tunnel Topology"
msgstr "隧道拓扑"

msgid "auto-off after %dh hard cap"
msgstr "%d 小时硬上限自动熄灭"

msgid "no hard cap"
msgstr "无硬上限"

msgid "Switch signaling"
msgstr "隧道开关信令"

msgid "Traffic (HTTPS)"
msgstr "访问流量（HTTPS）"

msgid "Copied ✓"
msgstr "已复制 ✓"

msgid "HomeTunnel — Settings"
msgstr "HomeTunnel — 设置"

msgid "Mode and daemon parameters."
msgstr "模式与开关参数。"

msgid "General"
msgstr "基本设置"

msgid "Recommended. on-demand: tunnel closed by default, opened from outside via the remote switch. always-on: tunnel connected at boot."
msgstr "推荐按需。按需：隧道默认关闭，通过Cloudflare侧隧道开关从外部打开。常开：开机即连接。"

msgid "Tunnel name"
msgstr "隧道名称"

msgid "Domain"
msgstr "域名"

msgid "Locked after authorization (falls back to editable after a router reinstall, when the Cloudflare authorization is lost). To re-choose, revoke it first."
msgstr "授权后锁定（路由器重装后 Cloudflare 授权丢失时，会退回可编辑状态）。如需更换，请先取消授权。"

msgid "On-demand parameters"
msgstr "按需模式参数"

msgid "Default TTL (min)"
msgstr "默认 TTL（分钟）"

msgid "How long the tunnel stays open after \"on\". Append ?min=N to the \"on\" link to override, up to the max."
msgstr "每次开启内网穿透后，隧道保持开启的时长。"

msgid "Max TTL (min)"
msgstr "最大 TTL（分钟）"

msgid "Upper limit for how long a single open keeps the tunnel on."
msgstr "单次开启最长可保持的时长上限。"

msgid "Auto-renew amount (min)"
msgstr "自动续期幅度（分钟）"

msgid "Renewal amount when traffic is detected near TTL expiry (in-use auto-renew)."
msgstr "临近 TTL 到期且检测到真实流量时，每次续期的时长（使用中自动续期）。"

msgid "Auto-renew while in use"
msgstr "使用中自动续期"

msgid "While the tunnel has real traffic (new requests / active streams), keep renewing the TTL. Idle → auto close."
msgstr "隧道有真实流量（新请求/活跃流）时持续续期 TTL；闲置则到期自动关闭。"

msgid "Hard cap (seconds)"
msgstr "硬熔断（秒）"

msgid "Local fuse: force-stop after this many seconds of continuous run; renewals do NOT extend it. 0 = unlimited (not recommended with auto-renew)."
msgstr "按需模式一次开启时间上限，到时会强制中断，自动续期无法突破。负责在无法发送关闭指令/忘记关闭时，关闭内网穿透服务，避免内网服务长时间暴露在公网。可以设置为0，表示不限。如果你开启了自动续期，强烈不建议设置为0。"

msgid "Poll interval (s)"
msgstr "轮询间隔（秒）"

msgid "Fail-closed threshold"
msgstr "失败熔断阈值"

msgid "Stop the tunnel after this many consecutive switch-service fetch failures."
msgstr "开关服务连续拉取失败达到该次数后停止隧道。"

msgid "cloudflared metrics port"
msgstr "cloudflared metrics 端口"

msgid "Local Prometheus metrics port of cloudflared (traffic signal for auto-renew)."
msgstr "cloudflared 本地指标端口（自动续期的流量信号源）。"

msgid "Edge protocol"
msgstr "边缘协议"

msgid "QUIC is default; switch to http2 if UDP 7844 is degraded/blocked on your line."
msgstr "默认 QUIC；线路 UDP 7844 劣化/受阻时切 http2。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Topology"
msgstr "拓扑"

msgid "Access"
msgstr "接入"

msgid "Ingress Rules"
msgstr "接入规则"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Authorization code:"
msgstr "授权码："

msgid "How to authorize:"
msgstr "如何授权："

msgid "Open the link above, or scan the QR code with a phone."
msgstr "打开上面的链接，或用手机扫描二维码。"

msgid "Log in to your Cloudflare account on that page."
msgstr "在打开的页面中登录你的 Cloudflare 账号。"

msgid "Confirm the page shows the same code as above, then click \"Authorize\"."
msgstr "确认页面显示的授权码与上方一致，然后点击「Authorize」。"

msgid "Come back to this page — it continues automatically."
msgstr "完成后回到本页，页面会自动继续。"


msgid "Tunnel switch domain"
msgstr "隧道启停控制域名"

msgid "Tunnel switching is done via URL, no page involved. Save the switch bookmarks from the Status page to start or stop the tunnel from any device."
msgstr "隧道启停通过 URL 完成，无需打开页面。请在状态页保存开关书签，即可在任意设备启动或停止隧道。"

msgid "Public entry"
msgstr "公网入口"

msgid "Non-HTTP service: connect with a cloudflared Access or WARP client using this hostname."
msgstr "非 HTTP 服务：需用 cloudflared Access 或 WARP 客户端连接此主机名。"

msgid "Disabled — not published"
msgstr "已停用 — 未发布"

msgid "reachable after setup completes"
msgstr "接入完成后可访问"

msgid "Tunnel is on. Valid for %d minute(s), until %s."
msgstr "隧道已开启。有效期 %d 分钟，至 %s。"

msgid "Tunnel is off."
msgstr "隧道已关闭。"

msgid "Tunnel Mode"
msgstr "内网穿透隧道运行模式"

msgid "Switch controller"
msgstr "开关控制进程"

msgid "Why HomeTunnel"
msgstr "为什么选择 HomeTunnel"

msgid "No public IP required"
msgstr "无需公网 IP"

msgid "— the router establishes an outbound connection to Cloudflare; home broadband behind NAT (or with only an IPv6 prefix) works out of the box."
msgstr "—— 路由器主动向 Cloudflare 建立出站连接，NAT 后的家庭宽带（甚至只有 IPv6 前缀）开箱即用。"

msgid "No DDNS required"
msgstr "无需 DDNS"

msgid "— every service opened to the public internet gets its own fixed hostname; Cloudflare detects the IP address automatically, so home IP changes are nothing to worry about."
msgstr "——  每个开放到公网的内网服务都有各自的固定域名，IP地址由CloudFlare自动检测，无需担心家庭IP变化"

msgid "Automatic encryption"
msgstr "自动加密"

msgid "— all inbound public traffic is automatically encrypted with HTTPS; Cloudflare issues and renews the certificates, no intervention needed."
msgstr "—— 所有公网流入流量自动HTTPS加密，Cloudflare自动签发与续期证书，无需干预。"

msgid "On-demand access"
msgstr "按需开放"

msgid "— keeping intranet services exposed to the public internet for long is risky. The tunnel stays closed by default and opens only when needed, with a convenient on/off switch reachable from any network. Even if you forget to close it, the tunnel stops by itself after the agreed time."
msgstr "—— 内网服务长时间开放到公网安全风险很大，本方案穿透隧道默认关闭，仅在需要时开启，提供任何网络可达的便捷开启与关闭方式。即使忘记关闭，隧道亦可在约定时间后自动停止。"

msgid "Free of charge"
msgstr "完全免费"

msgid "— uses only Cloudflare free-tier features (Tunnel, Workers, DNS)."
msgstr "—— 仅使用 Cloudflare 免费套餐能力（Tunnel、Workers、DNS）。"

msgid "Compared with frp / IPv6 tunneling"
msgstr "对比 FRPS 与 IPv6 方案"

msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "对比维度"

msgid "frp / IPv6"
msgstr "FRPS / IPv6 方案"

msgid "Public IP"
msgstr "公网 IP"

msgid "Not needed"
msgstr "不需要"

msgid "frp needs a server with a public IP; IPv6 needs a public IPv6 on every network path"
msgstr "FRPS 需要一台有公网 IP 的服务器；IPv6 需要全链路公网 IPv6"

msgid "Extra server"
msgstr "额外服务器"

msgid "None — Cloudflare edge is the entry point"
msgstr "不需要 —— Cloudflare 边缘节点就是入口"

msgid "frp needs a rented VPS running frps (paid, and you manage it)"
msgstr "FRPS 需要租用 VPS 跑 frps（付费，且需自行运维）"

msgid "HTTPS certificate"
msgstr "HTTPS 证书"

msgid "Edge-terminated, auto-issued and renewed"
msgstr "边缘终结，自动签发续期"

msgid "frps usually plain HTTP or self-signed; IPv6 needs its own certificate per service"
msgstr "FRPS 常为明文 HTTP 或自签证书；IPv6 每个服务都要自行配证书"

msgid "Address stability"
msgstr "地址稳定性"

msgid "Stable hostnames on your own domain"
msgstr "自有域名下的固定主机名"

msgid "frp: fixed only if you pay for the server IP; IPv6 prefix changes require DDNS anyway"
msgstr "FRPS 固定地址依赖付费固定 IP；IPv6 前缀变化照样要 DDNS6"

msgid "Firewall / ISP"
msgstr "防火墙 / 运营商"

msgid "Outbound-only connection; no inbound port opening"
msgstr "纯出站连接，无需开放入站端口"

msgid "frp server must open ports; IPv6 often firewalled or unavailable on mobile networks"
msgstr "FRPS 服务器必须开放端口；IPv6 常被防火墙拦截，移动网络下经常不可用"

msgid "Cost"
msgstr "成本"

msgid "Free"
msgstr "免费"

msgid "frp: VPS rental; IPv6: free but constrained"
msgstr "FRPS 需 VPS 租金；IPv6 免费但受限"

msgid "What you need"
msgstr "使用前提"

msgid "A Cloudflare account (free registration works)."
msgstr "一个 Cloudflare 账号（免费注册即可）。"

msgid "A domain hosted on Cloudflare — the DNS of your domain is managed by Cloudflare (registrar anywhere)."
msgstr "一个托管到 Cloudflare 的域名——域名 DNS 交由 Cloudflare 管理（注册商不限）。"

msgid "A router running the Homelede firmware with the HomeTunnel app installed."
msgstr "一台刷有 Homelede 固件并安装了 HomeTunnel 应用的路由器。"

msgid "How to use"
msgstr "使用方法"

msgid "Open the"
msgstr "打开"

msgid "page and follow the wizard: authorize with OAuth in the Cloudflare web page (creates subdomains, deploys the switch service [Worker] and configures its routes), pick your domain, and deploy the switch service."
msgstr "页，按向导操作：在 Cloudflare 网页完成 OAuth 授权（创建子域名，部署开关服务[Worker]及配置Worker路由）、选择域名、部署开关服务。"

msgid "Go to"
msgstr "进入"

msgid "and add what you want to expose — e.g. subdomain nas pointing at http://192.168.1.10:5000. DNS records are published automatically."
msgstr "页添加要暴露的服务——例如子域 nas 指向 http://192.168.1.10:5000，DNS 记录会自动发布。"

msgid "Save the ON / OFF bookmarks from the"
msgstr "把"

msgid "page to your phone. Open the ON link from any network to start the tunnel (default 45 minutes, auto-renewed while traffic flows), and the OFF link to close it immediately."
msgstr "页的 ON / OFF 书签保存到手机。在任意网络打开 ON 链接即开启隧道（默认 45 分钟，有流量自动续期），打开 OFF 链接立即关闭。"

msgid "Visit https://nas.example.com from outside — your NAS is there."
msgstr "在外网访问 https://nas.example.com —— 你的 NAS 就在那里。"

msgid "Security model"
msgstr "安全模型"

msgid "The tunnel is closed by default. It opens only on an ON link (time-limited) and closes automatically when idle or when the hard cap is reached."
msgstr "隧道默认关闭。只有 ON 链接能限时打开它，空闲或到达硬上限时自动关闭。"

msgid "The switch key never appears in the router config file — it lives only in /etc/hometunnel/ with 600 permissions."
msgstr "开关密钥不写入路由器配置文件——只存在于 /etc/hometunnel/，权限 600。"

msgid "Even while open, only the ingress rules you defined are reachable; everything else on the LAN stays invisible."
msgstr "即使隧道开启，也只有你定义的接入规则可访问，局域网其余部分完全不可见。"

msgid "Usage Guide"
msgstr "使用说明"

msgid "active"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "usable"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "not fully active"
msgstr "未完全生效"

msgid "The domain is fully served by Cloudflare (nameservers switched to Cloudflare, DNS resolution active)."
msgstr "：域名已在 Cloudflare 正常运行（NS 已切到 Cloudflare、DNS 解析生效）"

msgid "The domain was just added to Cloudflare, but its nameservers have not been switched over yet; Cloudflare has not taken it over."
msgstr "：域名刚添加到Cloudflare，但域名 NS未完成切换，Cloudflare 尚未完成接管"

msgid "Only domains marked as usable can be selected."
msgstr "只有状态为可用的域名才能被选择。"

msgid "pending"
msgstr "未完全生效"

msgid "Domain status legend:"
msgstr "域名状态说明："

msgid "The switch service controls starting and stopping the intranet-exposure tunnel. It will create a subdomain under the current domain: enter the subdomain the switch service should use, then click \"Deploy Now\"."
msgstr "开关服务是用于控制内网穿透隧道启停的服务，开关服务会在当前域名下创建一个子域名，请输入开关服务使用的子域名，随后点击“立即部署”"
